WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:05.830
<i>The only way to tell Earth 
about No. 4 Division's betrayal</i>

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.040
<i>is to take back the broadcast tower.</i>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:14.040
<i>To accomplish this, Wolf and the other 
non-combatants mounted a suicide mission.</i>

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:19.080
<i>Will they find glory in retaking the Annex 1,</i>

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.760
<i>or only death?</i>

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.900
K-Keiji?

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.920
I defeated him.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.290
Let's hurry

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.380
to the control room.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.930
Jirou?

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:40.940
Their heavily-armed "rescue 
ship" is about to land on Mars.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:42.930
Hong-chan,

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.090
it's time to stop playing around.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:47.210
Kill them with your full-power poison.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:26.190
Silent Fists

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.710
H-Huh?

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.060
No way...

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.000
What's wrong?

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.920
It won't open!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.060
Did that impact wreck the electronics?

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.830
Keiji, there's no time!

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.630
We'll meet at the final destination.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.010
The center of the second floor.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.560
The control room, right under 
the captain's quarters!

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.570
We'll use the computer there

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:49.560
to rewrite the tower's settings 
and restore it to normal!

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:55.210
No, you guys need to follow the original 
plan and find the protective suits.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:59.030
I'll go to the control room alone.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.400
You need those suits, right?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.460
Yeah.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:07.380
We'll only last another 
14 minutes at this rate.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.250
But...

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:13.310
No. 4 Division is obviously going to 
be waiting for us at the control room.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:17.800
Without the masks, 
there'll be even less time.

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:22.290
So I'll go first and fight them!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.270
What?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.830
Again...

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:39.780
There are more people without 
protective suits, right...?

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.890
This time from No. 1 and No. 2 Divisions...

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.590
I-Is there

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:55.160
any way we can resolve this peacefully?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.000
Th-They're people, too!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.930
Again...

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.290
Otherwise... again!

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:12.040
Hong-chan.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:26.870
Do you understand what's going on?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.550
How important this place is?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:36.880
You and me and Xi-san are traitors now.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:41.620
The only reason we're alive is that 
contact with Earth is cut off.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:45.000
If you stop emitting the 
poison, and they get inside

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.740
and tell Earth that we 
betrayed and killed everyone,

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:53.390
what will happen?

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.070
We'll be purged. 100%.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.400
Us, and your family back home, too.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:14.270
Why did you come here?

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:18.700
Why did you risk your life having that operation?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.970
It's because you love your 
mom and your siblings, right?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:37.120
Did you get scared when someone died 
right in front of you yesterday?

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:43.730
Wimping out now won't 
bring them back to life.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:49.040
I think it's actually insulting to them.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.910
Your job is to protect 
this place with poison.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.500
That's your mission, 
and you can't back out now.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:07.800
For your sake, for your family's 
sake, and for your comrades' sake,

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.380
you need to transform here

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.930
and give them the highest-density
 bacteria you can muster!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:18.720
All they have to protect themselves 
 are simple masks and coats.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.030
Is he really going to be okay, Wolf?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.020
Keiji doesn't have a suit!

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.610
He can't wear one when 
he's fighting either way.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:32.070
His arms are too big.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.740
Let's hurry!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.750
The magnetic fields are getting stronger!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:40.570
Above us is probably the N 
area on the fourth floor.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.770
The food storage area!

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:03.970
It's so thin.

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:05.610
I guess I can't help it.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.660
I'll have to train it all over again.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.380
Th-The intercom?

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:14.100
H-Hey, what the hell was that message?

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.180
Are they still inside?

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:22.060
That army on the hill was flapping 
their wings to blow away the poison.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:28.070
It looked like they used his speed 
to get him inside while it was gone.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.930
But they aren't coming after us!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.940
If that broadcast was a

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:39.490
message to other ones that made it 
inside the ship when we did....

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.810
Crap! They're also...

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.600
The mission's a failure!

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.160
They destroyed the remaining suits!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.900
Now we seriously

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.900
have to get to the communication 
room and back in just ten minutes!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.670
H-Hide!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:52.920
Little slo—

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.680
Hong-chan, get inside!

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.280
Okay!

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:03.080
Bao-san!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.110
From behind you, too!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.980
What do we do, Wolf?

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.150
They can't possibly...

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.310
Let's hurry!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:29.230
They're after the bacteria type!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.120
<i>Staff-wielding?</i>

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.830
<i>Not that that's...</i>

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:52.500
<i>...really surprising anymore!</i>

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.850
<i>The poison needle of a geography cone...</i>

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:27.070
<b>Geography Cone</b>
Classification: Conidae Conus
Found: South of Central Honshuu, Okinawa, the Indian Ocean.
It injects poison with a long tooth and swallows its prey whole.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.920
<i>They've got Mosaic Org—</i>

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.470
<i>No...</i>

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.420
<i>One more of those and I'm...</i>

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.980
<b>Annex 1 Interior
Consists of the following:
 An artificial low-gravity residential area.
A research facility that's kept clean.
Shower and disinfectant rooms to keep things inside,
 such as viruses, from getting out.
Storehouses for the transformation drugs.
Communications control room, provisions storeroom,
escape pod area, captain's quarters, etc.</b>

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.950
They haven't checked in 
like they're supposed to.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.210
Is it No. 1 and No. 2 Divisions?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.230
Not a chance. It would 
have to be the roaches.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:12.790
Can I share a bad premonition I had?

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.500
If you want to say something, 
tell me a joke instead.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.850
Find Unit 1, now.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:20.780
Yes, sir.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.470
Kill them if you have to.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.040
We will achieve our goal no matter what.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.690
We won't let them have Hizamaru Akari.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:36.270
Everyone's probably fighting 
to take back the tower now.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.390
I won't let them catch us!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.760
I'm going to let the whole world 
know what No. 4 Division did!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:49.460
I believe that we'll all be 
able to meet again safely,

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.790
but if something happens and 
you can't return to the ship,

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.980
head north.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.660
If there's any hope, it is there!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.760
Yes, to the north!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:05.200
I will protect you no matter what!

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.580
For the day when we meet again...

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:11.260
For our dinner on Earth!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.800
What are you doing, Hong-chan?

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.940
Get back inside!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:18.980
I can't!

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.750
I'll destroy their suits somehow.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.880
Until then, you get inside and transform...

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:25.800
I can't!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:29.320
There's a hole in your suit.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:33.030
If I transform, you'll die, too!

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.990
Do you really think you can handle 
them with that goddamn knife?

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.540
Just transform!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:39.970
Bao-san...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.840
I don't know how many of you there are.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:49.170
But I don't want you to die!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:55.330
If nothing else, you've got much more 
of a future than I do with this power.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.500
You wanted to be a novelist, right?

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.560
I think that's

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.550
a wonderful dream.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.550
<i>I-It's no good.</i>

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:09.270
<i>She's not cut out to be a 
weapon of mass destruction.</i>

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.660
<i>But even if she can transform here...</i>

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:16.520
<i>I can't believe they're wearing the suits.</i>

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.290
<i>And that nerve poison...</i>

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.810
<i>Damn it! My body won't do what I tell it.</i>

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.170
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.090
<i>Is this the end?!</i>

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.120
I figured you wouldn't be able to do it.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.670
But you did your best.

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:03.460
Still, who would've thought 
they'd put on the suits?

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.460
That's the communications room, right?

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:25.990
Rank 8?

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:27.550
Stay back...

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.150
Stay away!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:35.280
So it's this geography cone 
that's almost killed Bao-kun?

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.450
That was unexpected.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:41.330
The survival rate after a sting 
is less than 30%, I guess.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:45.540
And you tried to take that...

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.480
and use it on Hong, too, didn't you?

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:56.270
Xi-san, there's still poison in the air.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.300
Put on your suit!

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.320
No, this won't take long.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.770
Look at No. 1 Division's fighter.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:08.480
Hong, he realizes that you're the 
only one here without a suit,

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:11.730
and he's still just standing 
there unable to accept it.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.360
I'll finish them off...

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.330
Put on some clothes!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.910
Oh no, can you see my naughty bits?

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.950
I can! I'm a peacock mantis shrimp!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.130
Hide your lower half, not those!

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.400
Fine, if you insist.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.570
I do.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.340
I really will.

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.730
Please!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.410
Xi-san, your body is still...

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:49.690
I failed to turn you into a weapon 
when I was your instructor.

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.150
So I've come to take responsibility.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:17:00.210
And... personally, I like you as someone 
who isn't cut out to be a weapon.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.240
So I came to save you.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.150
And Rank 8...

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.840
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.510
Bao-san!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.500
Hong, get inside the communications room.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:27.520
I'll find all the other rats and kill them—

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.910
Not happening!

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:34.170
You moved the impact 
point at the last second?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:35.470
I let my guard down.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.620
But what's with this hand?

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.710
Why didn't you hit me from behind?

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.380
Don't tell me it's because you're a boxer?

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.770
It's not because I'm a boxer.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.710
It's because I'm a man.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.210
What are you going to do then?

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:57.230
Just as you guessed, 
she's the bacteria type.

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:00.420
Unless you kill her and me, not only

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.530
won't you make it into 
the communication room,

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:03.930
you'll die here!

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:09.710
I don't care if you're bluffing or 
if you give up on your beliefs now.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.650
I'm going to

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.030
kill you right now anyway.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.610
That won't change.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.080
I don't hit girls.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.520
I see.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:25.720
Then if you die here, 
I'll fall in love with you!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:32.190
<i>That was close.</i>

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.050
<i>She's really trying to kill me!</i>

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.260
<i>She's different than the others I've fought.</i>

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.690
<i>Her techniques and the 
way she moves her body</i>

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.630
<i>are totally different from boxing.</i>

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.070
What do you mean you won't hit a woman?

00:18:53.910 --> 00:19:00.420
You're not in the ring, or at a 
ballroom trying to impress a lady!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:03.080
At least tell me you don't want 
to hit a girl or children,

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:08.290
but you'll still choose to kill me rather 
than let me kill your friends,

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.460
you hypocrite!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.920
You could kill me with 
a mantis shrimp's punch.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:21.390
Do it.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:24.290
Give up on your little 
policy and just accept it!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.930
Or you'll die.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.210
Sorry.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:43.200
This is the fastest way to 
stop an armored-shell type.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:47.310
This is all your fault for not 
being able to do your damn job.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.200
Let's go.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.210
We'll find the others—

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:05.690
<i>What?</i>

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.220
<i>What is this guy? What is 
this guy? What is this guy?!</i>

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:12.350
I won't... let you go.

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:14.800
Stop it...

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.820
<i>Why won't he hit back after all that?</i>

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:24.530
When I was little my dad taught me

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.800
never to hit a woman.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.730
To be nice to them.

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:36.630
If nothing else, I know if I hit you 
with my mantis shrimp power you'll die.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.560
My goal isn't to kill you.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.400
Now come on...

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.460
I'm not dead yet.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.580
I won't hit a girl,

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.810
and I won't let you kill my friends.

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:55.320
This is my decision.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.650
So I'm sticking to it.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.700
And even so, I won't die!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:05.270
Because I'm... strong.

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:12.740
<i>That's right.</i>

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:18.000
<i>My goal isn't to kill anyone.</i>

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.660
Nakanojo Erika
Surgery Base: Japanese Gecko
M.A.R.S. Ranking 95

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:43.360
Six minutes left!

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:55.220
We can do it!

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:56.540
We can do this!

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.790
We can take back the tower!

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.700
Okay, everyone!

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.060
Let's save the world!

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
The Soul of The Weakest

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:40.510
This is the final blow!
